pdf-lib v1.17.1 (MIT), UMD build from npm package "pdf-lib".
Source: node_modules/pdf-lib/dist/pdf-lib.min.js after `npm install pdf-lib`.
Only change from upstream: the trailing "//# sourceMappingURL=..." comment
was stripped (no .map file is shipped, so the browser would otherwise try
to fetch it during devtools use).

To verify after re-vendoring: sha256sum pdf-lib.min.js
To update: fetch the new version the same way, strip the sourceMappingURL
line, recompute the hash, and update this file.
